Quick Verification QV-2026-0001

Title: Trump “I’ve done a shitty job as president” Clip

Review Published: September 29, 2026

Original Clip Date: September 29, 2026

Category: Edited Video / Quote Context

Current State of the Evidence: Authentic Quote, Incomplete Context

⸻

Purpose

This Quick Verification examines a viral video clip in which President Donald Trump appears to say:

“I’ve done a shitty job as president.”

The purpose is to determine whether the quotation is authentic and whether the circulating clip accurately represents the context in which it was made.

⸻

Original Claim

Viral posts on Reddit, TikTok, X, and other social media platforms circulated a short video showing President Trump saying:

“I’ve done a shitty job as president.”

Many posts presented the clip without additional context, implying that Trump was directly admitting failure as president.

